{"id":"da8df6fd73c2eb5e","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-relativized-recursive.md","title":"Relativized Recursive","display":"df-relativized-recursive — Relativized Recursive","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-relativized-recursive","aliases":["58-df-relativized-recursive"],"display":"df-relativized-recursive — Relativized Recursive","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-relativized-recursive"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-relativized-recursive</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relativized-recursive — Relativized Recursive"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"af73296236e5df83\" href=\"?note=af73296236e5df83\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md\">../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\\)</span> (oracle-computation value predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1d725a0797bae6df\" href=\"?note=1d725a0797bae6df\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S\\)</span> (relative-recursiveness predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S(B,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!y\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\n\\land(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow y=1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S(B,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!y\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\n\\land(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow y=1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S(B,A)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S(B,A)\\)</span> requires a total oracle-computable characteristic function, not merely a partial computation.</li>\n<li>Totality and output values are now stated through the registered oracle-computation relation; the prose-only term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^A\">\\(\\Phi_e^A\\)</span> no longer carries the operational semantics.</li>\n<li>Equivalently, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\leq_T A\">\\(B\\leq_T A\\)</span> under the decision-procedure convention.</li>\n<li>Relativized arithmetic-hierarchy classifications are downstream from this definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md","status":"resolved","id":"af73296236e5df83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-turing-machine.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d725a0797bae6df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)$ (oracle-computation value predicate; see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-recursion2-oracle-computation.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}recursive}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S(B,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nA\\subseteq\\omega\\land B\\subseteq\\omega\n\\land\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;\\forall x\\in\\omega\\;\\exists!y\\in\\{0,1\\}\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2OracleComputation}_S(y,e,A,x)\n\\land(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow y=1)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecursiveIn}_S(B,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_e^A","display":false},{"tex":"B\\leq_T A","display":false}],"bytes":1569,"backlinks":[{"id":"72859a2d81ce2e93","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"\"[[58-df-relativized-recursive]] — 相对化递归\""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1071","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-relativized-recursive.md|58-df-relativized-recursive]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","af73296236e5df83","5045d216c83e75cb","1d725a0797bae6df"]}